          "settings": {
            "question": "Is your cacao tested for heavy metals?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, our cacao has been tested for heavy metals and toxins and comes back with an absence of all of them according to EU standards and compliant with FDA laws. We are happy to say we have incredible results and we are happy to stand behind our cacao after these results. Every batch we order from Peru is tested. Find more info in our blog about this subject and our rigors of testing.</p>"
